Material Symbols Rounded
https://github.com/google/material-design-icons

Bundled here as `material-symbols-rounded.woff2` — a static instance with the
variable axes pinned to opsz 24, wght 400, FILL 0, GRAD 0 (362 KB). The full
variable font is 5,227 KB and renders identically at the single size and weight
this product uses; see specs/014-discover-redesign/research.md §R4.

It is shipped as a local asset rather than loaded from fonts.googleapis.com so
that icons work offline in the installed mobile app.

